branch: claude/piano-roll-clip-view-wozlie
includes: Device-feedback fix. The bio strip was showing impossible HRV values from the camera (e.g. "549.2 ms" — higher than the time between beats, which can't happen). Camera rPPG has noisy beat-to-beat timing, so it can inflate the HRV number. Science-first: the HRV readout now shows a real figure in ms only when it's physiologically plausible (3–300 ms) and "—" otherwise — never a wrong number. Chest-strap (BLE) HRV is unaffected; HealthKit's relative value still shows; the tap-to-learn now notes that reliable beat-to-beat HRV needs a chest strap. Bundles the prior AUv3 plugin-UI + IA-cleanup work. Display-layer only — no DSP changes. Verified: Xcode Compile Check + CI green.
